su name priest tools be map def
su name search be search fromstate wo web by num 3 can
su name download be download from filename as wo web to filename can
su name read be read from filename become wo text to name text out can
su name write be write ob text to filename can
su name list be list from filename as wo all can
su name command be command ob text to name text out can
prah

exists su name world tools ob bool truth ya
exists su name world root ob filename "world" be default ya
exists su name world agent ob text "confederation-priest" be text ya
exists su name world place ob text "workplace" be text ya

exists su name priest be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" ya
ob text "You are the Confederation Priest. Work inside world/workplace/confederation only. Use tools to search, download, read, write, list, and command as needed. Goals: update confederation knowledge (chronology, glossary, contacts), track new items from https://www.llresearch.org/channeling and https://www.buzzsprout.com/2320595, and leave a brief maintenance note." to name text review out for name priest with name priest tools at filename "world/workplace/confederation" be write do

ob name review out to filename "world/house/confederation-priest/ingredients/maintenance-note.txt" be write do
